# packages/gridpulse

- Foundational type: `PNetwork` (pandapower net + NetworkX graph). `load_network` returns `PNetwork`.
- Mutate pandapower state only via `PNetwork` methods (`apply_measurements`, `run_powerflow`, `set_*`, `copy`).
- Pandapower imports stay in `network/` and `powerflow/`. Other packages use domain types / `PNetwork`.
- Packages: `network`, `telemetry`, `quality`, `powerflow`, `anomaly`, `pipeline`, `ui`, `config`, `simulator`.
- Python ≥3.11; modern generics; project `.venv` via `uv`. pytest-first; coverage floor 75%.
- UI helpers read Stage 6 JSONL/events only — no second pipeline.
